  ],
  "credit": "chefburcinarda",
  "notes": "Silent video, no text, no amounts: all quantities are my estimates. Melting the chocolate is not shown (melt it in a bowl over a pan of hot water). The date looks already pitted. Setting time is not shown; the hearts look glossy and set by the end. Gold dust and flaked almonds are decoration."
